<p>StockChief prepares printable customer invoices from actual posted dispatches. Each saved copy includes its exact products, currency, recorded due date, partial shipments, trace details and posted return credits. Updated dispatches, payments and credits prepare a new copy; earlier copies remain in the history.</p>
<p>Growth learns from paperwork you individually approve and complete for the same customer and currency, within the example’s total. Pro and Custom require no teaching. Routine work starts after 14 days with your inventory set to Handle routine work. Payments, refunds, new customer decisions, physical handoff and sending require their separate controls. This job uses no model calls or AI credits.</p>
<% if(blocked){ %><p class="notice"><%= blocked %></p><% } %>
<section class="card"><h2>Prepare one invoice</h2><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/customer-invoices/prepare"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label>Invoice number <input name="invoiceNumber" required maxlength="150"></label><button class="btn" <%= blocked?'disabled':'' %>>Prepare for approval</button></form></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Customer routines</h2>
<% for(const r of rules){ %><article><h3><%= r.customer_name %> · <%= r.currency %></h3><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/customer-invoices/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="customerId" value="<%= r.customer_id %>"><input type="hidden" name="currency" value="<%= r.currency %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<%= r.revision %>"><label>Largest invoice total (<%= r.currency %>) <input name="maximum" inputmode="decimal" value="<%= r.maximum %>" required></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I confirm this customer and authorize private invoice preparation within this limit.</label><div class="actions"><button class="btn" <%= blocked?'disabled':'' %>>Save routine changes</button><button class="btn secondary" name="remove" value="1" formnovalidate>Stop this routine</button></div></form></article><% } %>
<% if(allowed){ %><h3>Enable another customer and currency</h3><form class="form-stack" method="post" action="/autopilot/customer-invoices/settings"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="0"><label>Exact customer name or email <input name="customerReference" required maxlength="150"></label><label>Currency <input name="currency" required minlength="3" maxlength="3" placeholder="USD"></label><label>Largest invoice total <input name="maximum" inputmode="decimal" required></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" required> I confirm this customer and authorize private invoice preparation within this limit.</label><button class="btn" <%= blocked?'disabled':'' %>>Enable invoice routine</button></form><% } %></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Queued or held invoices</h2><% if(!held.length){ %><p>No invoices are waiting in this view.</p><% } %><% for(const w of held){ %><article><strong><%= w.invoice_number %></strong><p><%= w.problem||'Queued for preparation' %></p></article><% } %></section>
<section class="card"><h2>Prepared invoice copies</h2><% if(!recent.length){ %><p>No customer invoice copies have been prepared in this view.</p><% } %><% for(const d of recent){ %><article><h3><a href="/autopilot/customer-invoices/<%= d.id %>"><%= d.invoice_number %> · <%= d.customer_name %></a></h3><p><%= d.automatic?'Routine preparation':'Individually approved' %> · <%= helpers.shortDate(d.created_at) %><%= d.superseded?' · Earlier copy; a newer version is saved':'' %></p><a href="/money/invoices/<%= d.invoice_id %>">Current posted invoice</a></article><% } %></section>
<nav class="actions" aria-label="Invoice pages"><% if(page>1){ %><a class="btn secondary" href="?page=<%= page-1 %>">Previous page</a><% } %><% if(more){ %><a class="btn secondary" href="?page=<%= page+1 %>">Next page</a><% } %></nav>
